# Third-party asset packs: re-download with `python3 tools/fetch_assets.py`.
# The files stay out of the public repo (some licenses forbid redistributing raw packs),
# but their .meta files and SOURCE.json records are committed so GUIDs stay stable.
/Assets/ThirdParty/**
!/Assets/ThirdParty/**/
!/Assets/ThirdParty/**/*.meta
!/Assets/ThirdParty/**/SOURCE.json
!/Assets/ThirdParty/README.md
/.asset_cache/

